2 CONT Stusser, Herman. Clothing, b. 1857 Lativa, Tacoma 1893-, d. 1921. Wife Betty (1856-1948), 9 children. Brother Solomon, 10 children. Sisters Mascha (Adolph Friedman) Bluma (P.J. Yudelson), and Jennie (Hugo Stusser.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Stusser, Hugo. Clothing, b. 1856 Latvia, Tacoma 1896-, d. 1929. Wife Jennie (1863-1928), children Augusta (Julius Friedman), Charles, Bessie (Caplan), Sam, Ben, Julius, and Lena (Pearl). Jennie's brother Herman immig. 1902, b. 185
2 CONC 7 Lativa, Tacoma 1893-, d. 1921, wife Betty (1856-1948), 9 children. Jennie's brother Solomon immig. 1907, 10 children. Jennie's sisters Mascha (Adolph Friedman) and Bluma (P.J. Yudelson).
2 CONT
2 CONT Stusser, Julius, shoemaker, b. Latvia 1868, Tacoma 1892, Spokane 1910 & 1920, then California, d. 1941. Wife Edith Hirschfeld (1869-1951) parents Leah and Sigmund Hirschfeld. Daughter Bernice Wolff Williams, (1898-1983.)
