1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Benjamin Stusser was born in Cape Town, South Africa in 1881.
2 CONT
2 CONT He  came to Australia in 1909.  Served here in W.W.1. in the Merchant Navy.
2 CONT
2 CONT He stayed in the Merchant Navy after the war.  At the time of his death in 1921 he was a Chief Steward.
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin had a ship board romance with Ada Maloney, they married in Port Adelaide, South Australia, 12 th February, 1914.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ada had 4 children to Benjamin.  Two daughters born in Port Adelaide, and Two sons born in Melbourne.
