1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Based on work of Malgosia Ploszaj from Rybnik, 2014:
2 CONT * Meta, born 1868 in Rybnik, married to prominent rabbi, historian and researcher Luis Lewin from Żnin.
2 CONT * Meta and Luis left Germany in 1939 and escaped to Palestine.
2 CONT * Dr. Luis Lewin died in 1941, Meta in 1955.
2 CONT * They had a son Daniel, probably named in honour of his grandfather. He also became a rabbi.
