1 NOTE {geni:about_me} GUTTMAN, Rebecca Riva (nee Klein). Peacefully in her ninety-fourth year, on Saturday, September 13, 2008. Beloved wife of the late Moe. Dearest mother and mother-in-law of David and Carole, Stephen and Donna of Isr
2 CONC ael. Cherished grandmother of Sylvia and Brian Lerman, Shari Guttman; Anna Guttman and Daniel Hannah of Thunder Bay, and Noah Guttman. Proud great-grandmother of Michael and Sean Lerman and Talia Hannah. Dear sister and sister-in-
2 CONC law of the late Florence and the late David (Dutchie) Sossin, the late Rita and the late Harry Bernstein, and sister-in-law of Sarah and the late Sol Guttman and longtime friend Ethel Manel, the late Anne and the late Ruby Neiman,
2 CONC  the late Jack Gerson (J.G.) and the late Rae Goodwin and the late Ann Goodwin. She will be lovingly remembered by her many nieces, nephews, relatives and friends. Special thanks and gratitude to the staff of Maimonides 7S and esp
2 CONC ecially Denise and Barbara. Funeral service from Paperman & Sons, 3888 Jean Talon St. W, on Monday, September 15, 2008 at 1 p.m. Burial at the Beth Ora Congregation Section, Kehal Israel Cemetery, D.D.O. Shiva at her son's house f
2 CONC rom 2 to 4 and 7 to 9 p.m. daily. Donations in her memory made to Montreal B'Nai Brith Food Baskets, (514) 733-5377. Published in the Montreal Gazette on 9/15/2008
