2 CONT Destructive Fire at Greymouth (By Electric Telegraph)
2 CONT
2 CONT Greymouth, Tuesday.  A destructive fire occurred here this morning, which destroyed the following buildings with the principal part of their contents:  Grey River Argus Office; Rae's (tailor); Kittelty's (bootmaker); Miss M'Naught
2 CONC en's (milliner); The Boundary Hotel; Levinski's (photographic establishment), partially destoyed; Wimsch's (furniture store), pulled down; Brockley's (tinsmith), gutted; Barclay's (butcher), greatly injured; Mrs. Buchell's Hotel (
2 CONC injured). 
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition to the above, several small cottages also suffered
