1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The sibling relationship of Moses Savinar and Louis Savinar is provisional. The great grandchildren of each man agree there is a relationship of the two families, but no conclusive records establishing that they we
2 CONC re siblings are known. Their birthplaces Chernigoff and Gomel are about 50 miles apart. Children of each man were born in Gomel (now Belarus). It is unlikely that Moses was the father of Louis. Louis died in 1938. Moses died in 19
2 CONC 25, and his obituary listed his three living sons as Jacob, Samuel, and Harry. No siblings are noted in the obituary.
2 CONT
