1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *[http://drhguy.com/2012/07/04/lyon-cohen-leonard-cohens-grandfather/  '''Photos]
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.leonardcohenfiles.com/arthurkurzweil.pdf   '''Lyon Cohen], Paternal grandfather of singer-songwriter Leonard Cohen, was also a very distinguished man who helped found many of the institutions that defined Jewish life i
2 CONC n Canada. He was a vice president of the first Zionist organization in Canada. He made a trip to the Holy Land.
2 CONT
2 CONT It was a very interesting journey. He met Baron de Hirsch and he planned and helped establish, for Canada, the Jewish Colonization Association,which was to settle Jewish refugees in the prairie provinces and on farms. He was the f
2 CONC ounder of the first Anglo Jewish newspaper in North America. It was called the Jewish Times, published in Montreal. He was also one of the founders of Congregation Shaar Hashomayim in Montreal. Also was was one of the organizers o
2 CONC f the Baron de Hirsch Foundation, B'nai B'rith, the Jewish General Hospital and the Hebrew Free Loan Association. [http://www.leonardcohenfiles.com/arthurkurzweil.pdf  ''Source]
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lyon_Cohen
2 CONT
