1 NOTE {geni:about_me} BERNSTEIN, Harry. On Friday, February 1, 2008. Beloved husband of the late Rita Klein. Loving father and father-in-law of Barbara and Bernie London, Sharon and Sheldon Polansky. Cherished grandfather of Jennifer an
2 CONC d Mark Dym, Jamie London, Erin and Loren Polonsky, Samara and David Starkman. Proud great-grandfather of Jesse, Hannah, Reuben, and Ephram. Dear brother of Phyllis and the late Louis Blidner, Margie and the late Ben Kahlenberg, an
2 CONC d predeceased by Goldie and Julius Weiser, Rachel and Sam Bloom, Shirley and Louis Simrod, Hyman and Estelle Bernstein, Fanny and Louis Friedman. Brother-in-law of Riva and the late Moe Guttman, the late Florence and the late Davi
2 CONC d Sossin. Funeral service from Paperman & Sons, 3888 Jean Talon St. W. on Monday, February 4 at 10 a.m. Burial at the Beth Ora Congregation Section, Kehal Israel Cemetery, D.D.O. Shiva at his daughter's home. In lieu of gifts or f
2 CONC lowers, donations in his memory may be made to the Harry Bernstein Memorial Fund for the Geriatric Department c/o Jewish General Hospital Foundation, (514) 340-8251. Published in the Montreal Gazette on 2/3/2008
