1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joe Russak was born in Seattle and lived his whole life in Seattle and passed away in his home in his favorite spot where he likes to sit in Seattle.  He was lucky enough to live at his home that he built over 50 y
2 CONC ears ago his whole life.
2 CONT
2 CONT Even at the age of 90 he still enjoyed going to work to Russak Investment Company as often as he could.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was lucky as well to have in Seattle surrounding him and spending alot of time whith him his Children and granchildren and greatgrandchildren..what a special blessing!
