2 NOTE Note from donor file: 1933 Seattle Talmud Torah graduating class. According to Jewish Transcript 9/18/33: Top row (L to R): Burton Steinberg, Moses Maimon (Rabbi Sol Maimon's older brother), Mendel Genauer, Melville (Mel) Oseran, 
3 CONC Nathan (Nate) Etkin, Joseph (Yoisie) Russak. Center row (L to R): E. Wolpin, M. Mottleson, Rabbi Max Wohlgelernter (Principal), A. E. Poplack, David Feldman. Seated (L to R): Irwin and Julian Berch (the Birch brothers), Label Kuto
3 CONC ff, Gussie Isaacson, Alvin Poplack, Irwin (Itsie Isaacson, Robert (Bob) Schmulman.
