1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My mother Lily was the youngest daughter of 8 children. Those who survived childhood were Bertha. Bernhard. William (Willy or Billy). Dora. My parents met when they were in high school - corresponded for 11 years a
2 CONC nd married in 1934. Before her marriage my mother was an elocution teacher and singer. Her parents wouldn"t allow her to make acting her career My parents lived in Wynberg and later in Kenilworth Cape Town. When my father retired 
2 CONC in 1976 they emigrated to Israel and made their home in Raanana. As teenagers both my parents were very active in the Jewish Youth Movements  - Young Israel and Habonim and were ardent Zionists all their lives My mother died in 19
2 CONC 94
