1 NAME Joseph Victor Berel /Finkelstein/
2 GIVN Joseph Victor Berel
2 SURN Finkelstein
2 _MARNM Finkelstein
2 NICK Vic
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 JAN 1938
2 ADDR
