1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hilde Markes nee Meinhardt was born in Schwedt, Germany in 13/03/1900 to Hugo and Helena.  She was married Leo. Prior to WWII she lived in Hattingen, Germany. During the war she was in Essen, Germany. Deported with
2 CONC  Transport VII/1, Train Da 70 from Duesseldorf, Düsseldorf, Rhine Province, Germany to Theresienstadt, Ghetto, Czechoslovakia on 21/07/1942. Deported with transport Ep from Theresienstadt, Ghetto, Czechoslovakia to Auschwitz Birke
2 CONC nau, Extermination Camp, Poland on 09/10/1944.  Hilde was murdered in the Shoah. Source: Yad Vashem. http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=3876273&language=en http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=4
2 CONC 892032&language=en http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=1386919&language=en
2 CONT
2 CONT ? declared dead 8 May 1945
