2 CONT Birth 1848/8482 Colac;  KETTLETIE, Henry, to KETTLETIE William and UNKNOWN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1879/2249 ;  KITTILTY, Henry, to HENRY, Marjory.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 Registered births to Henry Kittelty/Kettelty/Kittelly/Kittlety and Marjory/Margery/Margaret Henry;
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 Ballarat; Richard
2 CONT 1881 Ballarat; Charles Henry; d1952 Perth WA (mother; Burgess)
2 CONT 1883 Ballarat; Harry Andrew John; d1912 Boulder WA
2 CONT 1885 Ballarat; Ethel Eliza
2 CONT 1886 Waterloo; Lillian Louisa
2 CONT 1888 Waterloo; William Burgess; Divorce from Nellie 1927; m1927 Phyllis Castles; d1930 Sydney, 42.
2 CONT 1889 Waterloo; Violet Jane; died 1889, 1 month old.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Henry Kittelty married Marjory Henry in Victoria in 1879. Mary had 7 children in the next ten years. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry’s sixth child, William Burgess Kittelty married Phyllis Castles in Glebe, Sydney in 1927. They had two children before William died in 1930. Phyllis remarried to an Albert Duxbury in 1933 at Wollongong."
2 CONT
2 CONT BDM WA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death 1907/600008 Black Range Hospital;  Kittelty, Henry, aged 59, son of William KITTELTY and UNKNOWN
2 CONT
2 CONT Black Range Cemetery (Nunngarra) Western Australia. The Cemetery is in the Shire of Sandstone. 
2 CONT Nunngarra is 523km north from Kalgoorlie via Goldfields Highway.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Black Range Courier and Sandstone Observer WA Fri 11 Oct 1907; part article:
2 CONT
2 CONT Our Birrigrin correspondent writes :-
2 CONT
2 CONT Quite a gloom was cast over this town on Sunday last when it became known that Mr. Harry Kittelty, senr., one of our oldest and respected residents, had passed away at Nungarra. Much sympathy is felt for his son, Mr. Charles Kitte
2 CONC lty, who on receipt of the sad news left for Nungarra to attend the funeral.
2 CONT
2 CONT
