2 CONT The Ballarat Star Sat 18 Sept 1909 Page 1
2 CONT The funeral of Mrs Esther Kittelty took place on Friday from her late residence Warrenheip to the Ballarat New Cemetery and was well attended Messrs W Clark, H. Clark, J Dorrington and R Huggins acted as coffin-bearers and Cr W Ke
2 CONC nna and Messrs R Hockins, R. Bell, J Quinn, A. Ebsworthy, N. Devereaux, F Wescott and T. Eady were the pall bearers.  The Rev Mr Cuthbert officiated at the grave, and Mr Chas. Morris had charge of the mortuary arrangements. 
