2 NOTE I'd been doing family research since about 1994 and asked my grandmother about family photos, she brought out a few photos of the Jones family.
3 CONT
3 CONT After my grandmother died boxes and boxes of photos came out of her house, I had no idea she had this many photos of the Magee family,  I was stunned.  After I had asked my grandmother Dulcie on a few occasions over the years and 
3 CONC got not much info or photos from her. 
3 CONT
3 CONT I have heaps more Magee photos still to be loaded onto Geni.
3 CONT
3 CONT I'm so thrilled to be able to share the family photos this way. 
