1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QSQ-G9VW-6J77?i=67&cc=2296985
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QSQ-G9Z5-Q99N-C?i=205&cc=2141044
