1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nancy Mudrick, Louis' great granddaughter, recalls Esther Mudrick's description of her father. He had beautiful handwriting. Gertrude and Louis ran a boarding house, most likely at 447 Temple St in California Assem
2 CONC bly District 64. That's the address at which they are listed in the 1920 US census. Esther recalled that Louis did not help much with this. Esther met her future husband, Jack Mudrick, because he was a boarder there.
