1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Chicago Tribune: Nelson January 31, 2002 Dorothy A. Nelson, nee Apolsky, age 94, dear daughter of the late Libby and Harry Apolsky; beloved wife of the late Irving Nelson; devoted mother of Richard (Davida) Ne
2 CONC lson and Lynn Nelson; dear sister of Virginia (Alan) Kuper and the late Boris Aplon; loving grandmother of Cheryl (Joe) Ryan, Laurel (Mark) Kiesow, Debrah (Paul) Migetz and Amy (Rob) Nangle; proud great-grandmother of Kara and Zac
2 CONC hary Ryan, Andrew and Jordan Kiesow and Jaelyn Migetz; fond aunt of many nieces and nephews.
