2 FILE https://media.geni.com/p7/6256/3608/53444836d38631bc/mendelsohns_and_Feinbergs_original.jpg?hash=aacd3cb9d3125038abf33482c036d89b8f8c2ec34c1b9c9141e701d291256f96.1795161599
2 FORM jpg
2 TITL Mendelsohns, Feinbergs, Singers 1920s
2 NOTE Between Sonny and Hilda:  Essie Zaltsman, a cousin from Philadelphia who paid a legendary/memorable visit to SA in 1929, in the days before these overseas visits to family were more routine. The other person is her sister Rae.
2 NOTE Wow,another memory activator!Freda and Sadie were very close.
3 CONT Who is between Hilda and Sonny and between Tilly and Annie?
2 NOTE Many thanks for this info. Would be lovely to have some of the family photos from your dad's album up on Geni.
3 CONT
3 CONT Richard
2 NOTE  Richard - The event in this picture taken in Lansdowne on the steps of Sadie and Dave singers home was to recordthe visit of Essie and Ray Zaltsman cousins from Philadelphia who visted the family. They are standing on either side
3 CONC  of my father Sonny. On the right at the end is  my dad's sister Ray who died a few years after the visit. I have this photo and many others in my dad's photograph album from 1925 to 1934. -   Dov Hartuv
2 NOTE Hope I've got the identities of the people in the photo correct? Who are the ones I've failed to identify?
3 CONT
3 CONT Richard Mendelsohn
