1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p>Victor went to war during WW2. Was stationed in Eqypt and died their fighting at El Alamein 2 days before they left that area. He was apparently running back and forward to help the wounded when hewas killed by a mine. Nana and
2 CONC  the kids were living in the Corso at the time Gwen was only about 2 years old and Flora and Valda were at Mordialloc High School and I presume Vic was at Parkdale StateSchool. Grandad saw Gwen when she was born I think.</p>
