1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Oral history from Carole Krygger Marjory Henry left Henry Kittelty in aprox.1898 when living at Northcote Victoria. Marjory lived with a George Lambert until her death. Lambert is believed to be an assumed name. Af
2 CONC ter some years in the WA goldfields (aprox 1900-1925) Marjory returned to Victoria with her daughter Lillian and her family.
