1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ballarat The Courier
2 CONT
2 CONT McNeight - On March 15 at her home 1104 Lydiard Street North. Irene Rose McNeight loved wife of the late Angus loving mother of Daisy (Mrs W Goodie), Rob (dec), Earl (dec), Nancy (Mrs A. Longridge), Tom, Don and Neil (dec), Loved 
2 CONC mother in law of Bill (dec), Nellie, Tot, Alex (dec), Marj and June. Loving sister of Queenie (Mrs C Dillion) and Amy ( Mrs McLean). Aged 79 years. At rest.
2 CONT
2 CONT Loved mother of Don, mother in law of Marj loved Grandma of Susanne and Kerry. Peacefully sleeping in God's Care. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Loved mother of Rob (dec), dearly loved and loving mother in law and Gran of Nell and family. Sweet peace, the gift of God's love. Resting where no shadows fall.
2 CONT
2 CONT Loving mother of Daisy, mother in law of Bill (dec) fond Gran of Henry, Irene, Gordon and Bev. Called home. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Fell asleep March 16, loved mother of Earl (dec) mother in law of Tot, loved grandma of Angus, Maxwell and families. Peacefully sleeping. Memories live for ever.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dearly loved grandma of Graeme and Pat, great grandma of Donald and David Longridge. Treasured memories.
2 CONT
2 CONT McNeight - The funeral of the late Mrs Irene Rose McNeight of 1104 Lydiard st nth, will leave our chapel 19 Main street, for the Ballarat New Cemetery, today, Tuesday after a service commencing at Eleven (11.00) am. H Evans and So
2 CONC ns Pty Ltd Ballarat 2 1663
