1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Neil Gorsuch''' is an Associate Justice of the Supreme Court of the United States. Gorsuch is a proponent of textualism in statutory interpretation, originalism in interpreting the U.S. Constitution, and is an a
2 CONC dvocate of natural law philosophy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gorsuch clerked for Judge David B. Sentelle on the U.S. Court of Appeals for the D.C. Circuit from 1991 to 1992, and then for U.S. Supreme Court Justices Byron White and Anthony Kennedy, from 1993 to 1994. From 1995 to 2005, Gorsu
2 CONC ch was in private practice with the law firm of Kellogg, Huber, Hansen, Todd, Evans & Figel. Gorsuch was a Deputy Associate Attorney General at the U.S. Department of Justice from 2005 to his appointment to the Tenth Circuit. Gors
2 CONC uch was nominated to the United States Court of Appeals for the Tenth Circuit by President George W. Bush on May 10, 2006, to replace Judge David M. Ebel, who took senior status in 2006.
2 CONT
2 CONT He holds a Bachelor of Arts from Columbia University, Juris Doctor from Harvard Law School, and Doctor of Philosophy in Law from University College, Oxford.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 31 January 2017, Gorsuch was nominated by President Donald Trump for the U.S. Supreme Court to fill the vacancy caused by the passing of Associate Justice Antonin Scalia.  He was sworn in as a Supreme Court associate justice on
2 CONC  10 April 2017.
2 CONT
