2 CONT David Gutmann left Hainsfarth for the USA at the age of 14, arriving in New York on 04 Sep 1871 on the ship Deutschland departing out of Bremen. He died in San Francisco of diabetes at age 44. David was an entrepreneur in oil, rai
2 CONC ls, and mining. In 1878, he worked on mining ventures in Victoria, British Columbia, and his brother Jacob Gutmann joined him there the next year. Since 1880, he had settled in San Francisco.
