2 CONC  Kushelevsky". B'Or HaTorah. Retrieved 24 January 2011. ^ Jump up to: a b c d e f Krohn, Rabbi Paysach J. (October 2002). Reflections of the Maggid. Mesorah Publications. pp. 64–67. ISBN 1-57819-751-1. ^ Jump up to: a b Farnell, A
