2 CONC Searching for Meaning in the Maelstrom: Gaining strength and faith from the Torah renaissance that emerged from Churban Europe". The Jewish Observer. XXXVI (10): 13. Retrieved 24 January 2011. Jump up ^ Samsonowitz, M. "Rebetzin M
2 CONC ollie Isbee-Gurwicz: Chessed Unlimited in Yerushalayim (Part I)". Yated Ne'eman. Retrieved 24 January 2011. Jump up ^ Samsonowitz, M. "Rebetzin Mollie Isbee-Gurwicz: Chessed Unlimited in Yerushalayim (Part II)". Yated Ne'eman. Ret
2 CONC rieved 24 January 2011.
