2 CONT [http://www.legacy.com/obituaries/montrealgazette/obituary.aspx?pid=172404807 obituary] Montreal Gazette
2 CONT
2 CONT It is with great sadness that we announce the passing of Esther Frayda Cohen, beloved wife of the late Victor Cohen, cherished sister of Leonard Cohen and loving aunt of Lorca Cohen (daughter Viva) and Adam Cohen (wife Jessica and
2 CONC  son Cassius). Esther will be greatly missed by her family and all of her adoring friends around the world.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
