1 NOTE {geni:about_me} RITZ, Gerald Peacefully in Montreal in his ninetieth year, on Saturday, December 13, 2014. Beloved husband of Madeleine Ressler for sixty-two years. Devoted father and father-in-law of Heather and Joseph Paperman, 
2 CONC Lesley and Jeffrey Campbell. Cherished grandfather of Bram, Evan, Jason, and Stephanie Paperman; Jordan, Richard, and Corey Campbell. Dear brother-in-law of Eileen and the late Theodor (Ted) Goldman, the late Lois and the late Ros
2 CONC s Peters. Brother and brother-in-law of Roslyn and the late Leo Ritz, the late Selma and the late Leon Rosenbaum, the late Elaine and the late Ralph Ritz, the late Arthur Ritz. Funeral service from Paperman & Sons, 3888 Jean- Talo
2 CONC n St. W., Montreal, on Monday, December 15 at 12:00 noon. Burial at the Congregation Shaar Hashomayim Cemetery, 1250 chemin de la Forêt, Outremont. Shiva at 250 Clarke Ave. PH7, Westmount, QC. Contributions in his memory may be ma
2 CONC de to the "Gerald Ritz Memorial Fund" c/o the Alzheimer Groupe - A.G.I. (514) 485-7233 or c/o the Israel Cancer Research Fund (514) 481-2723.
