1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Frank Friedman was born in New York, a son of Benjamin Friedman    1884–? and Mary Friedman 1882–?, both immigrants from Russia.  He had siblings  Harry 1907–?,  Phillip Louis 1923–2008 #57995955, Sarah 1914-?, Ann
2 CONC a 1921-? and Phillip 1923-?.
2 CONT
2 CONT His family lived in Leola, South Dakota in 1930 where his father owned a cattle and hog company.  Frank was a printer at a local paper.
2 CONT
2 CONT Frank was a World War II and Korean War Army veteran, serving from 1942-1957.
2 CONT
2 CONT No other information could be found on his life or survivors.
